WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.621
Dominant hand and input.

00:00:01.621 --> 00:00:10.333
Confirm your dominant hand and preferred supported input method in the device's accessibility and input settings before practice.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:14.925
This release does not store a separate in-app dominant-hand profile.

00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:19.180
Input choices do not change the clinical sequence being taught.
